2. Name the scene "Match3Game" (or any name you prefer).
3. Create a new empty GameObject and name it "GameManager".
4. Create a new empty GameObject and name it "GameBoard".
5. Drag the "GameBoard" GameObject under the "GameManager" GameObject.

